# Dedicated Commons: "This land enters tapped unless you control a planeswalker." A replacement effect judged as the land
# would enter (CR 614.12), against the battlefield as it is: the ruling, "If Dedicated Commons enters at the same time as a
# planeswalker, that planeswalker isn't considered." Redshift's exhaust puts the Commons and Chandra, Chill of Compliance
# onto the battlefield together, so the Commons enters tapped.

